OL,3,GNEWSATeen tops 24-hour backflip world
OL,4,Arecord
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager from East Yorkshire claims
OL,7,Fhe has exceeded the existing Guinness
OL,8,FWorld Record for the most backflip
OL,9,Fsomersaults in 24 hours.
OL,11,FAustin Beasty, 18, from Market
OL,12,FWeighton, completed 2,470 flips, double
OL,13,Fthe record of 1,234 and is raising
OL,14,Fmoney for the Yorkshire Air Ambulance.
OL,16,FIndependent witnesses monitored the
OL,17,Fattempt in line with Guinness World
OL,18,FRecords' standards, but the
OL,19,Forganisation has yet to confirm the
OL,20,Frecord officially.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
